{"seq":1,"slug":"harmony","title":"大学音乐学 — 和声学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/music/music-theory/harmony","wordCount":2021,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学音乐学-和声学\">大学音乐学 — 和声学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>和声学（Harmony）是研究多个音同时发声时所形成的音响关系的学科，是西方音乐理论的核心支柱之一。理解和声意味着理解音乐中纵向维度的逻辑——为什么某些和弦组合听起来和谐稳定，而另一些则充满张力、渴望解决。</p>\n<p>和声学的基本对象是<strong>和弦（chord）</strong>，即三个或三个以上音同时或依序发出的组合。最基础的和弦是三和弦，由根音（root）、三音（third）和五音（fifth）构成。在此基础上衍生出七和弦（加入七音）、九和弦乃至更复杂的扩展和弦形式。</p>\n<p>核心概念包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调性（Tonality）</td>\n<td>以某一主音为中心，其余各音围绕其形成等级关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能和声</td>\n<td>和弦按照主（T）、下属（S）、属（D）三种功能运动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和弦转位</td>\n<td>将和弦的某音置于最低声部，改变音响色彩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声部进行</td>\n<td>多声部和声中各声部独立旋律线的写法规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止式（Cadence）</td>\n<td>乐句或乐段结束时固定的和弦进行模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变和弦</td>\n<td>含有临时升降记号的和弦，增加色彩张力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在数学与物理层面，和声的协和度与泛音列密切相关。完全协和音程（纯一度、纯八度、纯五度）对应简单整数频率比，如纯五度频率比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，纯四度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{4}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，大三度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{5}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这些简洁的比值使音响听起来融合而稳定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"三和弦与七和弦\">三和弦与七和弦</h3><p>在大调音阶上，每个音级都可以作为根音构成三和弦，由此得到七个自然音级三和弦：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>I</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>ii</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>iii</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>IV</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>V</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>vi</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msup><mtext>vii</mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{I} \\quad \\text{ii} \\quad \\text{iii} \\quad \\text{IV} \\quad \\text{V} \\quad \\text{vi} \\quad \\text{vii}^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7319em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ii</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">iii</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vii</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7319em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1208em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>大写罗马数字表示大三和弦，小写表示小三和弦，带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示减三和弦。其中最重要的三个和弦是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>I 级主和弦（Tonic）</strong>：调性中心，给人稳定、归属感</li>\n<li><strong>IV 级下属和弦（Subdominant）</strong>：向属运动，具有预备性</li>\n<li><strong>V 级属和弦（Dominant）</strong>：张力最强，强烈指向主和弦</li>\n</ul>\n<p>七和弦是在三和弦上方再加一个三度音。最常用的是 <strong>V7（属七和弦）</strong>，其特征在于含有三全音（tritone，即减五度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.414</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{1} \\approx 1.414</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.383em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.038em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.399em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9128em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8728em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1272em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.414</span></span></span></span></span> 的频率关系），造成强烈的不稳定感，迫切需要解决到主和弦。</p>\n<h3 id=\"声部进行规则\">声部进行规则</h3><p>传统四部和声写作中，声部从高到低为女高音（Soprano）、女中音（Alto）、男高音（Tenor）、男低音（Bass），简称 SATB。写作时需遵循若干原则：</p>\n<p><strong>平行五度与平行八度禁止</strong>：两个声部同向平行移动并形成连续的纯五度或纯八度，会使声部独立性消失，在巴赫时代的对位写作中被严格禁止。</p>\n<p><strong>声部距离</strong>：上方三声部（SAT）之间各自间距不超过一个八度；Bass 与 Tenor 之间可超过一个八度，但通常不超过两个八度。</p>\n<p><strong>导音解决</strong>：在大调中，VII 级音（导音）与主音仅差半步，因此在 V 级和弦中，导音原则上须上行解决到主音。</p>\n<p><strong>共同音保留</strong>：相邻两个和弦若有共同音，该音尽量在同一声部保持不动，以保证和声的平滑连接。</p>\n<h3 id=\"终止式\">终止式</h3><p>终止式是和声进行的标点符号，常见类型有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>完全终止（Authentic Cadence, AC）</strong>：V→I，且主和弦以根音在 Bass 声部</li>\n<li><strong>变格终止（Plagal Cadence）</strong>：IV→I，教堂音乐中常见&quot;阿门&quot;结尾</li>\n<li><strong>半终止（Half Cadence）</strong>：结束在 V 上，造成悬念感</li>\n<li><strong>阻碍终止（Deceptive Cadence）</strong>：V 之后不解决到 I，而是 VI 或其他和弦</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"调性扩展与半音和声\">调性扩展与半音和声</h3><p>18世纪之后，作曲家不断拓展调性边界。<strong>离调（Tonicization）<strong>是将某个非主调的音级临时当作局部调性中心处理，如在 C 大调中插入 E7→Am 的进行，把 Am（vi 级）当作临时的&quot;主&quot;；若这种过渡更完整，则称为</strong>转调（Modulation）</strong>。</p>\n<p>19世纪浪漫主义时期，半音和声（Chromatic Harmony）高度发展。<strong>那不勒斯和弦（Neapolitan Chord, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mtext>II</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\flat\\text{II}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">II</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</strong> 将 II 级音降低半音，产生异域色彩；**增六和弦（Augmented Sixth Chord）**包含意大利式、法国式、德国式三种变体，都以增六度音程（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>6</mn><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\flat\\hat{6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9079em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sharp\\hat{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1023em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）向属和弦强烈倾进。</p>\n<p>到了19世纪末20世纪初，瓦格纳（Wagner）在《特里斯坦与伊索尔德》序曲中使用的&quot;特里斯坦和弦&quot;（Tristan chord）——一个含多个变音的难以明确归属的和弦——成为调性瓦解的象征，预示了20世纪无调性音乐的到来。</p>\n<h3 id=\"爵士和声简介\">爵士和声简介</h3><p>爵士乐发展出了自己的和声语言，大量使用<strong>扩展和弦</strong>：九和弦（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>9</mn><mtext>th</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9^{\\text{th}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">th</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、十一和弦（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>11</mn><mtext>th</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11^{\\text{th}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">th</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、十三和弦（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>13</mn><mtext>th</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13^{\\text{th}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">th</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。爵士标准进行 ii–V–I 是其基本语汇：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Dm</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mtext>G</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mtext>C</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Dm}^7 \\rightarrow \\text{G}^7 \\rightarrow \\text{C}^{\\Delta 7}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Dm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9146em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9146em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>三全音替代（Tritone Substitution）</strong>：将 V7 和弦替换为与其相差三全音的另一个属七和弦。例如在 C 调中，G7 可被 D<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\flat</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span></span></span></span></span>7 替代，因为两者共享相同的三全音 B–F（异名同音）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在钢琴上分别弹奏 C 大调的 I、IV、V 三个三和弦，感受各自的功能色彩。尝试构建 I→IV→V→I 的完全终止进行。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>手写一段四小节 C 大调的四部和声，用 SATB 格式，选用 I、ii、IV、V、V7、vi 和弦，注意声部进行规则，避免平行五八度。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分析你熟悉的一首歌曲的和弦进行（可从简谱、吉他谱入手），标出每个和弦的级数，判断终止式类型。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：为什么属七和弦（V7）的解决感比纯粹的属三和弦（V）更强？从泛音列和音程角度解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>聆听巴赫《哥德堡变奏曲》咏叹调（Aria），识别其低音线条中的和声功能，尝试写出和弦标记。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>探究：爵士乐中的 ii–V–I 进行与古典功能和声中的 ii–V–I 在色彩上有何异同？扩展和弦带来了哪些新的音响可能？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>和声学的学习不应局限于规则记忆，更要通过大量聆听与分析来内化音响经验。以下是几个值得深入探索的方向：</p>\n<p><strong>经典教材</strong>：保罗·辛德米特（Paul Hindemith）的《作曲技法》（The Craft of Musical Composition）从泛音列出发重新解释和声逻辑；沃尔特·皮斯顿（Walter Piston）的《和声学》是英语世界最权威的大学教材之一；克罗马提克斯（Aldwell &amp; Schachter）的《和声与声部写作》则以巴赫风格为核心展开。</p>\n<p><strong>音乐分析实践</strong>：申克分析法（Schenkerian Analysis）将音乐的和声结构分为表层装饰音与深层骨架，认为所有调性作品最终都可还原为 I–V–I 的基本进行（Ursatz）。这是20世纪最具影响力的和声分析方法之一。</p>\n<p><strong>与作曲实践结合</strong>：和声学只有在实际创作中才能真正被消化。建议从改编民谣旋律的四部和声开始，逐步尝试加入离调、转调，直至半音和声写作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>和声学揭示了西方音乐纵向结构的逻辑。从三和弦到七和弦，从功能进行到半音扩展，和声构成了音乐叙事的情感骨架。学习和声学的关键在于：用耳朵聆听每一个规则背后的音响理由，而非单纯记忆条文。当你能够预感下一个和弦应该去往哪里，并理解为什么时，和声学的精髓才真正被掌握。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学音乐学 — 和声学","id":"大学音乐学-和声学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"三和弦与七和弦","id":"三和弦与七和弦"},{"level":3,"text":"声部进行规则","id":"声部进行规则"},{"level":3,"text":"终止式","id":"终止式"},{"level":3,"text":"调性扩展与半音和声","id":"调性扩展与半音和声"},{"level":3,"text":"爵士和声简介","id":"爵士和声简介"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"大学音乐学 — 对位法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/music/music-theory/counterpoint"}}